{"series":{"id":"ancient-god-sovereign","slug":"ancient-god-sovereign","title":"Ancient God Sovereign","image":"https://donghualife.com/uploads/images/1785379869677_5138695548536818921.jpg","synopsis":"El príncipe heredero supremo del Reino Espiritual es traicionado y muere víctima de una conspiración. Tras renacer como un humilde sirviente en el mundo mortal, obtiene una legendaria píldora divina, una técnica de cultivo incomparable y despierta dos almas marciales. Mientras elora antiguos reinos secretos y obtiene tesoros supremos, derrota a genios, sectas corruptas y poderosos enemigos con una sola espada. En su camino protege a sus aliados, desvela una conspiración ancestral y asciende paso a paso hasta convertirse en el Supremo Antiguo","genres":["Acción","Fantasía","Artes marciales","Aventura","Reencarnación"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/ancient-god-sovereign","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:36:51.727Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"1c684f19-e6bc-4db0-b19a-3f6af7a6deaf-temporada-1","slug":"1c684f19-e6bc-4db0-b19a-3f6af7a6deaf-temporada-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/1c684f19-e6bc-4db0-b19a-3f6af7a6deaf-temporada-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"ancient-god-sovereign","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/1c684f19-e6bc-4db0-b19a-3f6af7a6deaf-temporada-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:37:13.820Z","episodeCount":28,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":28,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"1c684f19-e6bc-4db0-b19a-3f6af7a6deaf-temporada-1-1","slug":"1c684f19-e6bc-4db0-b19a-3f6af7a6deaf-temporada-1-1","title":"Ancient God Sovereign — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/1c684f19-e6bc-4db0-b19a-3f6af7a6deaf-temporada-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/1c684f19-e6bc-4db0-b19a-3f6af7a6deaf-temporada-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:36:52.258Z","seriesId":"ancient-god-sovereign","seasonId":"1c684f19-e6bc-4db0-b19a-3f6af7a6d